1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Some people enter your life...
and quietly change everything.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Then there was you.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
A beautiful surprise
I never knew I was waiting for.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Your smile has a way
of making ordinary moments feel special.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:27,000
And somehow,
you make the world feel a little warmer.

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:33,000
I don't need perfect moments.

7
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:39,000
I just need moments
that I can share with you.

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Because with you,
even silence feels beautiful.

9
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:51,000
You are not just part of my story...

10
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:58,000
You are one of my favorite chapters.

11
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:05,000
And if I could choose
one place to be right now...

12
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:12,000
It would be somewhere close to you.

13
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:19,000
No grand promises.
No perfect words.

14
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Just this simple truth...

15
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:34,000
I am glad
that you are in my life. ❤️
